6. Services systemd

/etc/systemd/system/nexus-brain.service

```ini
[Unit]
Description=Nexus Brain Agent (FastAPI + Omega)
After=network.target mysql.service

[Service]
Type=simple
User=nexus
Group=nexus
WorkingDirectory=/opt/nexus/brain
ExecStart=/opt/nexus/brain/venv/bin/uvicorn main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=5

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
```

/etc/systemd/system/nexus-mesh.service

```ini
[Unit]
Description=Nexus Mesh Agent (Go)
After=network.target

[Service]
Type=simple
User=nexus
Group=nexus
ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/nexus-mesh
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=5

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
```

/etc/systemd/system/nexus-core.service

```ini
[Unit]
Description=Nexus Core Agent (Rust)
After=network.target nexus-brain.service
Requires=nexus-brain.service

[Service]
Type=simple
User=root
ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/nexus-core
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=5

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
```

/etc/systemd/system/nexus-omega.service (ton API Omega autonome)

```ini
[Unit]
Description=Nexus Cognitive Resonance Core (Omega API)
After=network.target

[Service]
Type=simple
User=nexus
Group=nexus
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 /opt/nexus/brain/resonance_core.py
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=5

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
```

Activation

```bash
sudo useradd -r -s /usr/sbin/nologin nexus 2>/dev/null || true
sudo mkdir -p /opt/nexus/{logs,config}
sudo chown -R nexus:nexus /opt/nexus/logs /opt/nexus/config

sudo systemctl daemon-reload
sudo systemctl enable --now nexus-omega nexus-brain nexus-mesh nexus-core
sudo systemctl status nexus-core nexus-brain nexus-mesh nexus-omega
```

---

7. Sécurité & audit (obligatoire)

7.1 Capabilities minimales pour Core

Édite nexus-core.service :

```ini
[Service]
AmbientCapabilities=CAP_NET_ADMIN CAP_SYS_ADMIN
CapabilityBoundingSet=CAP_NET_ADMIN CAP_SYS_ADMIN
NoNewPrivileges=true
ProtectSystem=strict
ProtectHome=true
ReadWritePaths=/opt/nexus/logs /opt/nexus/config
```

7.2 Logs centralisés

```bash
# Tous les agents loggent dans journald + fichiers séparés
sudo journalctl -u nexus-core -u nexus-brain -u nexus-mesh -u nexus-omega -f
```

7.3 Journalisation SQL des actions

Dans nexus-exec.sh, après chaque action, insère dans actions. Exemple minimal :

```bash
mysql -u nexus_agent -p"$NEXUS_DB_PASS" nexus_agents -e "
INSERT INTO actions (command, exit_code, executed_at)
VALUES ('$ACTION $TARGET', 0, NOW());"
```

(Crée un user MySQL dédié nexus_agent avec droit INSERT seul sur actions, jamais root.)

7.4 Mode "suggestion" par défaut

Tant que tu n’as pas validé la stabilité : dans main.py, renvoie approved=False partout sauf actions warn/noop. Le Core n’exécutera rien de destructif.

---

8. Test end-to-end

```bash
# 1) Brain seul
curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/decide \
-H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
-d '{"source":"manual","payload":{"cpu_usage_avg":95,"mem_used_mb":1000,"mem_total_mb":8000}}'
# → {"action":"warn","target":"cpu",...}

# 2) Mesh
curl http://127.0.0.1:9100/health
curl http://127.0.0.1:9100/agents

# 3) Core (voir logs)
sudo journalctl -u nexus-core -f

# 4) Exec (manuel)
/opt/nexus/exec/nexus-exec.sh '{"action":"warn","target":"cpu"}'
/opt/nexus/exec/nexus-exec.sh '{"action":"restart","target":"ssh"}'
/opt/nexus/exec/nexus-exec.sh '{"action":"restart","target":"postgres"}' # → REFUSED
```

